You kill ghosts just as you kill other types of monsters, beat, zap,
cast (spell) or throw (weapon) them to death. However, the chance of hitting
it is small if you are not experienced enough, so better run away and go to
another level if you can. Also, a dagger is good against them but the best
way is to run since they are twice as slow as you are. Once you gain enough
experience, strenght and a good weapon, give them hell !
